  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Assessing Necessary Skills**\n\nI\'m now identifying the essential skills for this task. I see that \'computer-use\' is directly relevant, specifically for that ultra-mode browser. I\'m excluding the database and SEO related skills as they don\'t seem applicable here.\n\n\n**Evaluating Firebase Need**\n\nI\'m reconsidering Firebase integration. While initially dismissed, I now see its potential for features like RSVP and pass generation in a fresher\'s party website. However, I\'m leaning toward local storage for a simpler, in-browser experience, especially given the lack of backend requirements in the prompt. I\'m weighing the complexity of Firebase against the benefits of transient user data and interactive elements.\n\n\n**Refining Skill Relevance**\n\nI\'ve refined skill relevance further. Frontend design is clearly essential, as is \"ultra-mode\" and \"computer-use.\" I\'m deliberately omitting skills like Gemini API and Google Maps, as the prompt doesn\'t explicitly require them. I\'m focusing on the core frontend requirements for a straightforward event website.\n\n\n"
