  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Website\'s Purpose**\n\nI\'ve clarified the website\'s purpose, aligning with the `frontend-design` document. It\'s a dual-function Freshers Party website for the AIML Department, serving as both an event landing and registration platform. My focus is on landing & marketing, as outlined in Section 4. This is a crucial first step in mapping the project\'s scope.\n\n\n"
