  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the modular UI components for this project. Specifically, I\'m working in parallel on `/src/components/ResilientImage.tsx`, `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`, `/src/components/HeroSection.tsx`, and `/src/components/HighlightsBento.tsx`. This approach should enhance development speed and maintain modularity.\n\n\n**Expanding UI Components**\n\nI\'ve expanded the UI component definitions to include `/src/components/ScheduleSection.tsx`, `/src/components/ShowcaseSection.tsx`, `/src/components/RsvpPassSection.tsx`, and `/src/components/Footer.tsx`. Additionally, I\'m working on `/src/utils/passExport.ts` to render a crisp PNG pass. I\'m focusing on ensuring strict adherence to the frontend design rules, such as the 3-zone top bar contract in `Navbar.tsx` and zero-pill metadata presentation.\n\n\n**Refining UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on UI element specifics, like using native `<button>` elements with clean designs and whitespace control for the \"Talent & Mr./Ms. AIML\" section. I\'m eliminating comment prefixes, uppercase shouting, and unnecessary visual clutter. The Hero section incorporates `items-stretch`, `lg:h-full object-cover` and a full-width event details strip. I\'m also ensuring accessibility with native HTML elements and descriptive labels.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "q7ABa-CwHLSsqtsP3vTGmQc"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_16026486629449927233"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { ImageOff } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface ResilientImageProps {\\n  src: string;\\n  alt: string;\\n  fallbackTitle: string;\\n  className?: string;\\n  loading?: \'eager\' | \'lazy\';\\n}\\n\\nexport function ResilientImage({\\n  src,\\n  alt,\\n  fallbackTitle,\\n  className = \'\',\\n  loading = \'lazy\',\\n}: ResilientImageProps) {\\n  const [hasError, setHasError] = useState(false);\\n\\n  if (hasError) {\\n    return (\\n      <div\\n        role=\\\"img\\\"\\n        aria-label={alt}\\n        className={`flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#18181F] via-[#121216] to-[#09090B] text-zinc-400 p-6 ${className}`}\\n      >\\n        <ImageOff className=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-[#F5A623]/70\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" />\\n        <span className=\\\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-300 text-center\\\">\\n          {fallbackTitle}\\n        </span>\\n      </div>\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <img\\n      src={src}\\n      alt={alt}\\n      loading={loading}\\n      referrerPolicy=\\\"no-referrer\\\"\\n      onError={() => setHasError(true)}\\n      className={className}\\n    />\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create ResilientImage component enforcing Zero-Broken-Image policy with referrerPolicy and styled fallback container\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ResilientImage.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating ResilientImage component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create ResilientImage component\"}"
