  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Verification Process**\n\nI\'ve just initiated Verification Round 1 using `playwright-cli`. The process involves opening `http://localhost:3000` in a desktop browser at `1440x900` resolution. I\'m capturing the initial desktop screenshot and saving it as `.playwright-cli/r1-desktop-hero.png`. This is the first step in validating the system within a real browser environment.\n\n\n**Analyzing User Journeys**\n\nI\'m now diving into user journey verification. I\'m focusing on three key journeys, from empty RSVP submissions to event planning and song requests. I\'ll be using `run-code` to validate the flow and capture specific screenshots, like the RSVP pass. I\'m also preparing to examine mobile viewport behavior, ensuring no horizontal overflow and adhering to sticky header constraints.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "BLMBa4-dB9OeqtsPv8nusAc"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7672126783406885646"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r1-desktop-hero.png && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n  const report = {};\\n  await page.waitForLoadState(\\\"networkidle\\\");\\n  // Check image loading & horizontal overflow on desktop\\n  report.desktopOverflow = await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth);\\n  report.images = await page.evaluate(() =>\\n    Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(\\\"img\\\")).map(img => ({\\n      alt: img.alt.slice(0, 35),\\n      complete: img.complete,\\n      naturalWidth: img.naturalWidth\\n    }))\\n  );\\n\\n  // Journey 2: Schedule filtering & bookmarking\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#schedule\\\").scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Stage\\\" }).click();\\n  report.stageCount = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"schedule-list\\\\\\\"] > div\\\").count();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Add Mr\\\\. & Ms\\\\. AIML 2026 Pageant to my plan/i }).click();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"My Plan (1)\\\" }).click();\\n  report.savedCount = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"schedule-list\\\\\\\"] > div\\\").count();\\n\\n  // Journey 3: DJ Song Queue upvote & add, plus Talent Audition tab\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#spotlight\\\").scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n  const upvoteBtn = page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Upvote Starboy/i });\\n  const beforeVoteText = await upvoteBtn.innerText();\\n  await upvoteBtn.click();\\n  const afterVoteText = await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Remove vote for Starboy/i }).innerText();\\n  report.songVoteChange = { before: beforeVoteText.trim(), after: afterVoteText.trim() };\\n\\n  await page.getByLabel(\\\"Song Title\\\").fill(\\\"Blinding Lights\\\");\\n  await page.getByLabel(\\\"Artist\\\").fill(\\\"The Weeknd\\\");\\n  await page.getByLabel(/Your Name & Section/i).fill(\\\"Ananya \302\267 Sec B\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Add to Queue\\\" }).click();\\n  report.songAddedVisible = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"song-queue-list\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Blinding Lights\\\").isVisible();\\n\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"tab\\\", { name: /Mr\\\\. & Ms\\\\. AIML \\\\/ Talent/i }).click();\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#talent-name\\\").fill(\\\"Nikhil Rao\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#talent-roll\\\").fill(\\\"26AIML105\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#talent-pitch\\\").fill(\\\"A 3-minute stand-up comedy set about surviving first-semester Python labs.\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Reserve Slot\\\" }).click();\\n  report.talentAddedVisible = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"talent-roster-list\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Nikhil Rao\\\").isVisible();\\n\\n  // Journey 1: RSVP validation + Pass generation + Persistence\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp\\\").scrollIntoViewIfNeeded();\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Generate Entry Pass\\\" }).click();\\n  report.rsvpValidationShown = await page.getByText(/Enter your full name/i).isVisible();\\n\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp-name\\\").fill(\\\"Ananya Sharma\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp-roll\\\").fill(\\\"26AIML042\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp-email\\\").fill(\\\"ananya.sharma@aiml.edu\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp-section\\\").selectOption(\\\"Section B\\\");\\n  await page.locator(\\\"#rsvp-dining\\\").selectOption(\\\"Vegetarian\\\");\\n  await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"Generate Entry Pass\\\" }).click();\\n\\n  report.passIssuedVisible = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"digital-entry-pass\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Pass Issued\\\").isVisible();\\n  report.passNameVisible = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"digital-entry-pass\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Ananya Sharma\\\").isVisible();\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r1-rsvp-pass.png\\\" });\\n\\n  // Reload to verify persistence\\n  await page.reload({ waitUntil: \\\"networkidle\\\" });\\n  report.persistedAfterReload = await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"digital-entry-pass\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Ananya Sharma\\\").isVisible()\\n    && await page.locator(\\\"[data-testid=\\\\\\\"digital-entry-pass\\\\\\\"]\\\").getByText(\\\"Pass Issued\\\").isVisible();\\n\\n  // Mobile viewport check\\n  await page.setViewportSize({ width: 390, height: 844 });\\n  await page.evaluate(() => window.scrollTo(0, 0));\\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n  report.mobileOverflow = await page.evaluate(() => document.documentElement.scrollWidth > window.innerWidth);\\n  report.mobileHeaderHeight = await page.evaluate(() => document.querySelector(\\\"header\\\")?.getBoundingClientRect().height || 0);\\n  await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r1-mobile.png\\\" });\\n\\n  console.log(\\\"VERIFICATION_REPORT:\\\", JSON.stringify(report, null, 2));\\n}\' && \\\\\\nplaywright-cli console\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running Round 1 browser verification\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run Round 1 browser verification\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\344\r\n\341\r\001i\024}\023\356\333\243P\277\032,S\f\304{\275_\fl\216\362\250\222%\315%#\277$6S\177)\212\031w\210\360U\302&\354\257\326\315\337$\032\227\002\237\327\v\315\355o\343\224\026+\322|5<oIGr\016\264\317\225\017\257>\362\270\204\361\345\t~\204\374@\031,\004`\245\0351\262\221m\355\307[U|<\213iq\216\305{b\305\317AF\024Y\r\231Q!\273g\223Dj\205\232\334\370&D\320\305z\357\315\304\375J\357\320{\237\365\376\311%S7E]\365x\016\321\236\017o\036\342`.T\312\262\323Y\210\203\033\274\026\274&\030\353n7u\316\327\245V\331\204\004F\301,~P\030wXh\1770=.\377\261\214~\245\301\n\001\035\033\274\342k\274\306\253\277\341\267k\213\367L\324H\256\177\305\314\037\"L%i\237\\\332d\274s\242\327{\251\016\205S}\357\252\201\000D=B\te\234\225\257\017\374@3Bk\323\b\'\226\257\200\314\001\326\vZ\333\232\374\372\226H\\\2258\016\327#\242\261H\312\216\302$\251=\226k\216\016n\267\"9\020_\273\266\262\026(\233=,w~\030\320\220\3278\302\317u#\n\240\203-\357\257\3442v\331\006\017\270\371\326\031^!\f\033(\365\\u`\375\f\021#\246\265S\251\313~\244\304a\345\276\311!\373K\003\0220cC\252!\364\360\033o\304\344D\b\364\23630\216@\270\345~@\250[\232\373y\377\035\365Mg\002\245\250\022\231\365]\310\242\005\240#O\241\026\036\300f\036\222{\250\304)\nE!}[\366\334\036*\273>I(\201\\\357N\256Ij6T\241\314W\023\nzM\366\330\271\353r\245t\317\204v\250\033\325\031\346\2064\370C\276\251\001{.w\217N\221[\265\351\302\267\b\232j\222\200bC\222\352\301I\364\371N\267\033i\2428\027v\302\256\225.\215\251\333\217\236\323\241X\274n\036\354\207\312\272\247\340\360{h\370\262\032\367f\324\347\031x%u\355\367\245.=7@\305`th\371\266\346\230+\274\226;\256\367\312\354k\336#\f\301\3709\271\270o\222\275\245\334Yo\242\236\201Z\370\037{@\365 \260\365\322\306 {\332l\202\033\\\220]\253\nCrR\324\333]\365\210R\v\220\262\300\204\246^.\363\303\302.\267B\350\276\274c.#D\032\222\216(h=\264q\335y\244\'\234\256\205\\Y\260\227+\240q\275%\256r\177m`p,\302`_k\035\0017\353=\330b\030\250\236Q\223,\356\004\rS\f4\035*\344\214`\240Q\0