  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Immaculate Design**\n\nI\'m struck by the immaculate quality. The absence of errors and warnings across all screenshots is remarkable. Each generated image and interactive element renders flawlessly. The craftsmanship is truly extraordinary.\n\n\n**Analyzing Visual Deficiencies**\n\nI\'ve shifted my focus to a meticulous visual inspection. I\'ve identified a key polish defect in the showcase section, specifically the header wrapping awkwardly within the Fresher Participation Hub card. The mobile hero image also has an orphan dot in the department kicker. Addressing these issues will significantly enhance the user experience by improving readability and visual balance, and I\'m eager to find a fix for them.\n\n\n**Refining Text Presentation**\n\nI\'ve just refined the text presentation. By making the department separator `hidden sm:inline`, the typographic blemish of a trailing middle dot has been removed, improving clarity. I\'ve also added `scroll-mt-20` to each anchor-targeted section, ensuring crisp breathing room below the sticky header.\n\n\n"
